  "body": "This PR migrates the WebHID specification from ReSpec (`index.html`) to Bikeshed (`index.bs`) and updates the repository metadata and boilerplate for the Devices and Sensors WHATWG Workstream:\r\n\r\n1. **Commit 1 (`Convert specification to Bikeshed`)**: Automated 1:1 conversion from ReSpec to Bikeshed (`CG-DRAFT`), verified side-by-side against the original ReSpec output.\r\n2. **Commit 2 (`Update metadata to make it a WHATWG Living Standard`)**: Updates `<pre class=\"metadata\">` to `Group: WHATWG` (`H1: WebHID`, `Shortname: hid`), adds the `#acknowledgments` section, resolves WHATWG Bikeshed linter warnings, and applies the standard WHATWG repository templates via `whatwg/spec-factory`.",
